 CellLabel->"Out[91]=",ExpressionUUID->"ed6676f4-5a1b-6841-a7d3-e6e6a489e9fc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The distribution of first reproduction ages shows that most agents \
reproduce almost immediately after reaching the minimum reproduction age, \
which, in this experiment, was set to 4. Moreover, this suggests that the \
environment is rich in resources and thus conducive to the population\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s growth, as agents can have sufficient energy and food to \
reproduce immediately and find mates. Additionally, the median first \
reproduction age of 7.40 furthers this pattern, indicating that at least half \
of the agents reproduce early in their lifespans. Also, the distribution is \
right-skewed, which explains the disparity between the mean and median age at \
first reproduction (9.70 and 7.40, respectively). Most agents reproduce \
before 10 ",
 StyleBox["T",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " of age, which is 6 ",
 StyleBox["T",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " after they reach reproductive maturity. There are however some, that do \
not until later ages, and this likely occurs in high-competition scenarios \
near carrying capacity. A quarter of the agents reproduced as soon as \
possible before reaching an age of 5 ",
 StyleBox["T",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98865028780822*^9, 3.988650310551819*^9}, {
  3.988759827955641*^9, 3.98875982845566*^9}, {3.9887600846218376`*^9, 
  3.9887601652741833`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2b953699-55e1-ab4c-8214-\
c4a424f0e9f9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Visualization", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9828692436483173`*^9, 3.9828692508295784`*^9}, {
  3.9861326943131332`*^9, 3.986132694674059*^9}, {3.9861334294481373`*^9, 
  3.9861334447826405`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"adf5e6db-afa9-bd4e-9bfa-\
226c9171a445"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two scaling functions are used to convert between ",
 StyleBox["D",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " units and pixels for the image based on the parameters of the model"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9866608898196545`*^9, 3.986660898595459*^9}, {
  3.988756986200115*^9, 3.9887570060248985`*^9}, {3.9887570963800793`*^9, 
  3.988757096456127*^9}, {3.988757187293909*^9, 
  3.9887571874818745`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0c769ac5-fd39-954a-af93-\
3ce8e73e5e3b"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"lUnitsToPixels", "[", 
   RowBox[{"lUnits_", ",", " ", "params_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"lUnits", " ", "*", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<imageSize\>\"", "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<squareBounds\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<squareBounds\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"lPixelsToUnits", "[", 
   RowBox[{"lPixels_", ",", " ", "params_"}], "]"}], ":=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"lPixels", " ", "*", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<squareBounds\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<squareBounds\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<imageSize\>\"", "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], "Code",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9887572135223236`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[33]:=",ExpressionUUID->"13d73f85-3a37-ba4f-9512-042548106f26"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For our visualization, we created a function called ",
 StyleBox["displayGrid",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " which styles the text, energy bars, etc. and formats the agents with the \
function ",
 StyleBox["drawAgentGraphic",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". Initially, we combined all these aspects of our code into ",
 StyleBox["displayGrid",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " itself by using the Module function inside of Table, but we found that \
using a separate function, such as drawAgentGraphic, to handle other \
formatting allows us to significantly increase efficiency. First,",
 " we gather the following information"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9883986891810875`*^9, 3.988398709588295*^9}, {
  3.9885677112091904`*^9, 
  3.9885678057151337`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c9240b80-893a-4048-841b-\
557bdebd6e22"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"    ", 
  RowBox[{
  "agents", ",", " ", "foods", ",", " ", "min", ",", " ", "max", ",", " ", 
   "span", ",", " ", "nAgents", ",", "\n", "    ", "hudPad", ",", " ", 
   "agentR", ",", " ", "foodR", ",", " ", "barW", ",", " ", "barH", ",", " ", 
   "barGap", ",", "\n", "    ", "showEnergyBars", ",", " ", "legendX", ",", 
   " ", "legendY", ",", " ", "infoX", ",", " ", "infoY", ",", "\n", "    ", 
   "agentGraphics", ",", " ", "foodGraphics", ",", " ", "legend", ",", " ", 
   "infoText"}]}]], "Code",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9883993006652946`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[35]:=",ExpressionUUID->"cc7f88a3-9110-f948-809c-40e1dd2e9bb9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To simulate how agents interact with one another in an environment, we \
created a square visualization window bounded by the parameter ",
 StyleBox["squareBounds",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " to render agents, food/resources, energy levels, ages, and other \
characteristics for each timestep. The function first extracts all agent \
information from the main association. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9858872836735134`*^9, 3.985887333646532*^9}, {
  3.985887375511841*^9, 3.9858874105025845`*^9}, {3.9858874642860413`*^9, 
  3.985887600183935*^9}, {3.986133446189781*^9, 3.9861334572457447`*^9}, {
  3.986134081567087*^9, 3.9861340825917263`*^9}, {3.98613522389324*^9, 
  3.986135226836588*^9}, {3.98839935763109*^9, 
  3.9883993698863316`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"06ce39a2-5a12-e24b-9dcc-\
9a94c95b3922"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"agents", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<agents\>\"", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"foods", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<foods\>\"", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"min", ",", " ", "max"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"params", "[", "\"\<squareBounds\>\"", "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Code",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9858876177569065`*^9, {3.9861334030906696`*^9, 3.9861334141985397`*^9}, {
   3.988290459901697*^9, 3.988290467930231*^9}, 3.988290526578823*^9, {
   3.9883986821214886`*^9, 3.9883986827372627`*^9}, 3.9883993555408154`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[35]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e2f15b16-b3ab-b241-bf99-6c91cc225e71"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{
  "Set", "shape", 
   "\"Lists \\!\\(\\*RowBox[{\\\"{\\\", RowBox[{\\\"min\\\", \\\",\\\", \
\\\"max\\\"}], \\\"}\\\"}]\\) and \\!\\(\\*RowBox[{\\\"params\\\", \\\"[\\\", \
\\\"\\\\\\\"squareBounds\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"]\\\"}]\\) are not the same \
shape.\"", 2, 37, 2, 28024722323124841338, "Local"},
  "MessageTemplate",
  BaseStyle->"MSG"]], "Message",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9887603718066063`*^9, 3.9887604193328896`*^9, 
  3.9887638653501434`*^9},
